{"sha": "6ff29f3430cdd19037674b8bdfd378d7f6d0526634f723d912bdf48c0405823d", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffcalc:8}", "$J_f = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 2y\\\\ 2x & 1\\end{pmatrix}$, $\\det J_f =", "1 - 4xy$。在 $0$ 处，$\\det = 1 \\neq 0$，为局部微分同胚", "（由\\cref{thm:b2:diffcalc:inverse}），且", "\\[", "\\dd(f^{-1})_{(0,0)} = (J_f(0))^{-1} = I_2 .", "\\]", "球上的可逆性：需 $4\\abs{xy} < 1$ 处处成立；在", "$\\norm{(x,y)}_2 < r$ 上，$\\abs{xy} \\leq \\frac{x^2 + y^2}{2} <", "\\frac{r^2}{2}$，故 $r = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}$ 可取；且它是最大的：", "在 $(x, y) = \\bigl(\\tfrac12, \\tfrac12\\bigr)$ 处，范数为", "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}$，$\\det J_f = 0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffcalc:9}", "$f(t) = (\\cos t, \\sin t)$：$f(0) = f(2\\pi) = (1, 0)$，然而 $f'(t) =", "(-\\sin t, \\cos t)$ 的范数为 $1$，从不为零：不存在使", "导数为零的点 --- 罗尔定理没有向量类比。均值", "不等式显然成立：$\\norm{f(2\\pi) - f(0)} = 0 \\leq", "2\\pi \\cdot \\sup\\norm{f'} = 2\\pi$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffcalc:10}", "$f(x+h) - f(x) = 2\\langle x, h\\rangle + \\norm h^2$: $\\dd f_x =", "2\\langle x, \\cdot\\rangle$，$\\nabla f(x) = 2x$，黑塞矩阵 $2I$", "（常值）。对 $g$：", "\\[", "g(x + h) - g(x) = \\langle Ax, h\\rangle + \\langle Ah, x\\rangle", "+ \\langle Ah, h\\rangle", "= \\bigl\\langle (A + A^{\\mathsf T})x,\\ h\\bigr\\rangle +", "O(\\norm h^2),", "\\]", "故 $\\nabla g(x) = (A + A^{\\mathsf T})x$，且 $H_g = A +", "A^{\\mathsf T}$，为常值。由\\cref{exo:b2:diffcalc:11}，$g$ 为", "凸函数当且仅当 $A + A^{\\mathsf T}$ 半正定 ---", "只有 $A$ 的对称部分起作用，正如 $g(x) =", "\\langle \\frac{A + A^{\\mathsf T}}2 x, x\\rangle$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffcalc:11}", "$f$ 为凸函数当且仅当其在每条线段上的限制为凸函数，", "即每个 $\\varphi(t) = f(a + tv)$ 为凸函数。由链式", "法则得 $\\varphi''(t) = \\langle H_{a+tv}\\,v,\\ v\\rangle$。", "", "若所有黑塞矩阵都半正定：$\\varphi'' \\geq 0$，", "故每个 $\\varphi$ 为凸函数（本科一年级分册），从而 $f$ 为凸函数。", "反之，若 $f$ 为凸函数，则每个 $\\varphi$ 为凸，故", "$\\varphi''(0) \\geq 0$：$\\langle H_a v, v\\rangle \\geq 0$ 对", "每个 $a$ 与每个方向 $v$，所有黑塞矩阵", "都半正定。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:diffcalc:12}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 由均值不等式", "        （\\cref{thm:b2:diffcalc:mvi}）应用于 $g$：", "        $\\norm{g(x) - g(y)} \\leq k\\norm{x-y}$，故", "        \\[", "        \\norm{f(x) - f(y)} \\geq \\norm{x - y} - \\norm{g(x) -", "        g(y)} \\geq (1 - k)\\norm{x - y} :", "        \\]", "        $f$ 为单射，且 $f^{-1}$（定义于像集上）", "        为 $\\frac{1}{1-k}$-利普希茨映射。", "  \\item 固定 $y$，$T(x) = y - g(x)$ 满足 $\\norm{T(x) -", "        T(x')} = \\norm{g(x') - g(x)} \\leq k\\norm{x - x'}$：一个", "        $\\R^n$ 这一完备空间上的压缩映射。巴拿赫", "        （\\cref{thm:b2:metric:banach}）给出一个不动点 $x^*", "        = y - g(x^*)$，即 $f(x^*) = y$：$f$ 为满射。", "  \\item 于是 $f$ 为 $\\R^n$ 上的双射，其", "        逆为 $\\frac{1}{1-k}$-利普希茨映射：一个整体反函数", "        定理，其中 $\\dd g$ 处处足够小，", "        取代了", "        \\cref{thm:b2:diffcalc:inverse} 中的局部可逆性假设。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:diffcalc:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\norm{ABx} \\leq \\vertiii A\\norm{Bx} \\leq", "\\vertiii A\\vertiii B\\norm x$：对 $\\norm x = 1$ 取上确界。", "矩阵乘积、$\\det$ 与 $\\operatorname{tr}$ 都是", "元素的多项式函数，从而连续（$\\mathcal M_n(\\R)", "\\simeq \\R^{n^2}$，所有范数等价", "（\\cref{thm:b2:nvs:finitedim}）。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\sum\\vertiii{X^k} \\leq \\sum\\vertiii X^k <", "\\infty$：级数绝对收敛，从而收敛", "（\\cref{thm:b2:nvs:absoluteconvergence}）。由 $(I -", "X)\\sum_{k\\leq N}X^k = I - X^{N+1} \\to I$：和为 $(I -", "X)^{-1}$。范数：$\\leq \\sum\\vertiii X^k = \\frac{1}{1 -", "\\vertiii X}$；且", "\\[", "(I - X)^{-1} - I - X = \\sum_{k\\geq2}X^k = X^2(I - X)^{-1},", "\\qquad", "\\vertiii{X^2(I-X)^{-1}} \\leq", "\\frac{\\vertiii X^2}{1 - \\vertiii X} = O(\\vertiii X^2).", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{3.} $A + H = A(I + A^{-1}H)$，其中 $\\vertiii{A^{-1}H}", "\\leq \\vertiii{A^{-1}}\\vertiii H < 1$：由第 2 问知其可逆：", "半径为 $\\vertiii{A^{-1}}^{-1}$、以 $A$ 为心的开球位于", "$GL_n(\\R)$ 中。稠密性：$\\det(A + \\varepsilon I)$ 是 $n$ 次", "多项式（关于 $\\varepsilon$），首项系数为 $1$：它", "只有有限多个根，故存在 $\\varepsilon_k \\to 0$", "使 $A + \\varepsilon_kI$ 可逆，且收敛于 $A$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 对 $\\vertiii H < \\frac{1}{2\\vertiii{A^{-1}}}$：", "\\[", "(A + H)^{-1} - A^{-1}", "= \\bigl[(I + A^{-1}H)^{-1} - I\\bigr]A^{-1},", "\\]", "其范数至多为 $\\frac{\\vertiii{A^{-1}H}}{1 -", "\\vertiii{A^{-1}H}}\\,\\vertiii{A^{-1}} \\leq", "2\\vertiii{A^{-1}}^2\\vertiii H \\to 0$：$\\Phi$ 在", "每个 $A \\in GL_n(\\R)$ 处连续。", ""]}